        "heading": "Costa Rica, by someone who lives here.",
        "body": "<p>Julián Monge is a real estate agent in Nosara — raised on the Nicoya peninsula, working from Playa Guiones. This shop is two things: our own Pacific-coast merch, and a tightly-curated Amazon shelf of real Costa Rican goods worth shipping anywhere.</p><p>Our merch is printed on demand by Printful — no overstock, no waste. Our Amazon picks are real Tico products we either grew up with or stand behind. If something stops being good, it comes off the shelf.</p>",
